in="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Business management systems built around your internal processes</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="benefits" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Why businesses choose custom development</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:132:13"><ul class="space-y-2" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:134:15"><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Custom functionality that matches how your business actually works, rather than adapting the business to a plugin</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Scalability, because the architecture is chosen for the expected data and traffic</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Better control over performance, code quality and what gets shipped</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Integration with the CRM, accounting, inventory or third-party services you already use</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Performance, since the application only loads the code it needs</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Business-specific workflows, approvals and permissions built into the product</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="process" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Our development process</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:150:13"><ol class="space-y-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:152:15"><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">1</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">01 — Requirement analysis</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">We document what the application must do, who uses it and which systems it needs to talk to.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">2</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">02 — Architecture &amp; planning</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Stack selection, data model, integration points, hosting and a delivery sequence.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">3</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">03 — UI / frontend development</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Responsive interfaces built from a shared design system with accessibility in mind.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">4</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">04 — Backend development</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">APIs, business rules, authentication and permissions implemented server-side.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">5</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">05 — Database &amp; integration</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Schema, queries and connections to external services and internal tools.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">6</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">06 — Testing</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Functional testing, edge cases, cross-device checks and review before release.</span></span></li><li class="flex gap-4" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:154:19"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary font-display text-sm font-bold text-primary-foreground" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:155:21">7</span><span data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:158:21"><span class="block font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:159:23">07 — Deployment &amp; maintenance</span><span class="block text-foreground/80" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:160:23">Release, monitoring, documentation and ongoing fixes or improvements.</span></span></li></ol></div></div></section></div><div class="mt-14" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/PageTemplate.tsx:136:13"><di